<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38043" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπᾰνάγκ-ης</span></b> , used only in neut.: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπάναγκές [ἐστι</span>] <i>it is
				compulsory, necessary,</i> c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				878e
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν ἐ. ἔστω</span> let
			there be no <i>compulsion,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				765a
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Smp.</u>
				176e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as
			Adv., <i>on compulsion,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κομῶντες</span> wearing long hair
				<i>by fixed custom,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.82
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λέγειν, ἐντίθεσθαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				34.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λαβεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					576
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. βουλὴν ἀθροισάτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1100.50
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐπάναγκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					15.28
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
